    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new high-density residential complex in a fairly established metro area. I need to prep for a town hall meeting with the locals. Can you give me a rundown of the main criticisms or pushback we're probably going to get regarding the zoning changes?",
