      "content": "You can expect significant pushback concerning increased traffic congestion and parking shortages, as existing infrastructure in established areas is often strained. Residents may also voice strong concerns about changes to neighborhood character, including overshadowing, loss of green space, and strain on local amenities like schools. Property values are another common talking point; some may argue that high-density projects will negatively impact the surrounding area's quality of life.",
